    heading: "install-the-sdk-2",
    content: "Agora SDK uses `libc++` (LLVM) by default. If you need to use `libstdc++` (GNU), please contact support\\@agora.io. The library provided by the SDK is a FAT Image, which includes 32/64-bit simulator and 32/64-bit real machine versions."
